  objectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab81382a0dc6c604894d1bce668915ce, type: 3}
  questDescription: Old Brandt the smith. Forty years of hammering, and this anvil
    must last forever, the sturdiest ever, and guard me from every spark, as safe
    as possible! Blades forged on it come out properly sharp, a tiny bit faster.
  requirements:
  - type: 1
    tier: 3
  - type: 6
    tier: 3
  - type: 3
    tier: 2
  - type: 2
    tier: 1
  successText: Ha! Forty more years of forging! This anvil sings like new!
  partialText: Hm. It rings. Not like in my youth, but it rings.
  failureText: My poor old anvil! You've wrecked it, you young rascal!
